Wat je gaat doen As an EPT Warehouse Operator at GEODIS, you make sure customer orders are picked correctly and on time and prepared for shipment. You work with a hand scanner and EPT and are active in the warehouse every day.

Your tasks include:- Picking orders with a hand scanner and EPT;
- Checking products, quantities and quality;
- Packing orders and preparing them for shipment;
- Safely moving goods around the warehouse;
- Placing products in the correct location;
- Following safety and quality procedures;
- Working together with colleagues to achieve daily targets;
- Keeping your workplace clean, safe and organized.

You mainly work from 09:00 to 18:00. Once every three weeks, you work from 07:30 to 16:30.   Wat we je bieden At GEODIS, you get a stable job with guaranteed hours and fixed day shifts.

You can expect:- €14.99 to €16.20 gross per hour, depending on experience;
- Guaranteed 32 to 40 hours per week;
- Fixed day shifts;
- Travel allowance of €0.25 per kilometer, up to €12.50 per working day;
- Temporary contract with the possibility of a permanent contract;
- 8% holiday allowance;
- 24 vacation days based on full-time employment;
- Opportunities to grow within GEODIS;
- Access to training and opportunities to obtain logistics certificates;
- A modern, clean and safe warehouse;
- An international working environment.

Through Start People, you receive the same employment conditions as employees directly employed by GEODIS.

