We ask that you:- Have proven warehouse experience;
- Have daily experience working with an EPT;
- Have experience working with a hand scanner;
- Are available for 32 to 40 hours per week;
- Are willing to work fixed day shifts;
- Speak and understand English;
- Are physically fit and enjoy active work;
