Wat je gaat doen As a warehouse operator, you are an essential part of the process. Together with your colleagues, you ensure that raw materials are delivered to internal production departments and external customers accurately and on time.

You will combine physical work with administrative tasks. Safety, accuracy, and quality are central to everything you do. In this role, you will use equipment such as RF scanners and SAP, and operate a forklift or reach truck to organize the work efficiently.

What will you do?- Accurately weigh and process raw materials (powders and liquids)
- Prepare and supply raw materials for production
- Replenish and manage raw material inventory
- Scan and check products according to quality requirements
- Perform various warehouse tasks using a forklift, reach truck, or combi truck

Working Hours – 3 shifts- Morning: 07:00 – 15:00
- Afternoon: 15:00 – 23:00
- Night: 23:00 – 07:00

   Wat we je bieden - Gross hourly wage of €17,73, excluding shift allowance;
- 20,5% shift allowance on all hours worked;
- 25 vacation days + 8% holiday allowance;
- 13 ADV days and a 13th-month payment incorporated into a flexible benefits budget;
- Travel allowance of €0.21 per km;
- Temporary contract through Start People, with the possibility of a permanent contract based on good performance.

At Start People, we operate on the principle of equal pay; your terms and conditions of employment always match those of colleagues who are employed directly by the client. This means that, in addition to your hourly rate, your terms and conditions of employment also include, for example, the number of days off, allowances, time-off-in-lieu payments and other pay components.   Functie-eisen - Available to work full-time in a 3-shift system;
- Experience operating a forklift; experience with a reach truck is a major advantage. Is your certificate no longer valid? No problem—we can arrange this for you!;
- Good command of Dutch or English (minimum B2 level);
